        "TileImage": "$($repository 091677fc-3b70-4bed-ad03-57837f1bb539).Image",
        "Description": "On your way back to the Batcave you got confronted by an undercover assassin. Of course you knocked him out and interrogated him. You get to know that there&apos;s 4 more undercover hitman in the Iceberg Lounge, and that all of them were hired by Alexa Carlisle, Because she&apos;s vengeful, and she wanted revenge for he&apos;s son. You need to kill them, to get Alexa know that you&apos;re gonna get her. Sooner or later. Because you&apos;re the hero this city needs. But not the one it deserves.",
